,"motivo_incerta":"Uncertain; Possibly; perhaps; modello unc/uncertain","significato":"basin, washbowl, vat","termine_origine":"*palagana","catena":[{"codice":"la","nome":"Latin","termine":"*palagana","categoria":"non_precisato"},{"codice":"qsb-ibe","nome":"Paleo-Hispanic","termine":"","categoria":"non_precisato"},{"codice":"mop","nome":"Mopan Maya","termine":"","categoria":"prestito"}],"lontana":"mop","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"Uncertain. * Perhaps from a hypothetical Latin *palagana (“gold panning pan”), from palaga (“gold nugget”), a chiefly Iberian term of Paleo-Hispanic origin. * Possibly borrowed from Mopan Maya [Term?].","origine_varieta":"la"}]}